{
  "title": "Component Variants",
  "slug": "component-variants",
  "description": "Learn how to build a complete button system with size variants, style variants, and interactive states. Start with a single button and evolve it into a flexible component library powered by CSS custom properties.",
  "difficulty": "intermediate",
  "duration": "25 min",
  "order": 3,
  "accentColor": "var(--color-secondary)",
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "Create a basic button",
      "instruction": "Every component system starts with a single element. Let's create a clean, well-styled button with sensible defaults. Notice how we set font-family to inherit\u2014a small detail that prevents buttons from falling back to the browser's default font.",
      "code": "<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">display</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">inline-flex</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">align-items</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">center</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">justify-content</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">center</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">padding</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">10px 20px</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">font-size</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">14px</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">font-weight</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">500</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">font-family</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">inherit</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">border-radius</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">8px</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">border</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">none</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">cursor</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">pointer</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">background</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#3b82f6</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">color</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#ffffff</span>;\n}",
      "codeFilename": "button.css",
      "preview": "<div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border-radius:8px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;\">Click Me</span></div><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5a6375;margin-top:8px;\">A single, well-styled button</p>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Add size variants",
      "instruction": "One size rarely fits all. Let's create small, medium, and large variants using modifier classes. Each size adjusts padding, font-size, and border-radius proportionally. The base .btn class holds shared styles, while .btn-sm, .btn-md, and .btn-lg handle sizing.",
      "code": "<span style=\"color:#546e7a\">/* Base styles */</span>\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">display</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">inline-flex</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">align-items</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">center</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">font-weight</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">500</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">border</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">none</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">cursor</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">pointer</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">background</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#3b82f6</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">color</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#ffffff</span>;\n}\n\n<span style=\"color:#546e7a\">/* Size variants */</span>\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn-sm</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">padding</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">6px 12px</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">font-size</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">12px</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">border-radius</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">6px</span>;\n}\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn-md</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">padding</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">10px 20px</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">font-size</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">14px</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">border-radius</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">8px</span>;\n}\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn-lg</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">padding</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">14px 28px</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">font-size</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">16px</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">border-radius</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">10px</span>;\n}",
      "codeFilename": "button.css",
      "preview": "<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"padding:5px 10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;border-radius:6px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;\">Small</span><span style=\"padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border-radius:8px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;\">Medium</span><span style=\"padding:10px 22px;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;border-radius:10px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;\">Large</span></div><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5a6375;margin-top:8px;\">Three sizes, same component</p>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Add style variants",
      "instruction": "Now let's create visual variants\u2014primary, secondary, and ghost. Each conveys a different level of emphasis. Primary is for the main action, secondary for alternatives, and ghost for low-emphasis actions. This maps directly to variant properties in Figma.",
      "code": "<span style=\"color:#546e7a\">/* Style variants */</span>\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn-primary</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">background</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#3b82f6</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">color</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#ffffff</span>;\n}\n\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn-secondary</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">background</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#f0f1f4</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">color</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#121726</span>;\n}\n\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn-ghost</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">background</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">transparent</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">color</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#3b82f6</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">border</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">1px</span> solid <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#e2e5eb</span>;\n}",
      "codeFilename": "button.css",
      "preview": "<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border-radius:8px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;\">Primary</span><span style=\"padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border-radius:8px;background:#f0f1f4;color:#121726;\">Secondary</span><span style=\"padding:7px 15px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:#3b82f6;border:1px solid #e2e5eb;\">Ghost</span></div><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5a6375;margin-top:8px;\">Visual hierarchy through variants</p>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Add interactive states",
      "instruction": "A button that doesn't respond to interaction feels broken. Let's add hover, focus, and disabled states. The focus-visible selector is especially important\u2014it shows a focus ring for keyboard users but hides it for mouse clicks. Accessibility and polish, all in one.",
      "code": "<span style=\"color:#546e7a\">/* Hover state */</span>\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn-primary:hover</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">background</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#2563eb</span>;\n}\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn-secondary:hover</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">background</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#e2e5eb</span>;\n}\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn-ghost:hover</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">background</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#f0f1f4</span>;\n}\n\n<span style=\"color:#546e7a\">/* Focus state */</span>\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn:focus-visible</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">outline</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">2px</span> solid <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#3b82f6</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">outline-offset</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">2px</span>;\n}\n\n<span style=\"color:#546e7a\">/* Disabled state */</span>\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn:disabled</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">opacity</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">0.5</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">cursor</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">not-allowed</span>;\n}",
      "codeFilename": "button.css",
      "preview": "<div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;\"><span style=\"padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border-radius:8px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;\">Default</span><span style=\"padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border-radius:8px;background:#2563eb;color:#fff;\">Hover</span><span style=\"padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border-radius:8px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;outline:2px solid #3b82f6;outline-offset:2px;\">Focus</span><span style=\"padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border-radius:8px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;opacity:0.5;\">Disabled</span></div><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5a6375;margin-top:8px;\">Every state covered</p>"
    },
    {
      "title": "Complete button system",
      "instruction": "For the final step, let's power the whole system with CSS custom properties. Each variant overrides the same set of tokens, making the system easy to extend. Want a new variant? Just define three custom properties. This is the same mental model as component properties in Figma.",
      "code": "<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#546e7a\">/* Token-driven defaults */</span>\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">--btn-bg</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#3b82f6</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">--btn-color</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#ffffff</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">--btn-hover-bg</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#2563eb</span>;\n\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">display</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">inline-flex</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">align-items</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">center</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">background</span>: <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">var</span>(<span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">--btn-bg</span>);\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">color</span>: <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">var</span>(<span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">--btn-color</span>);\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">transition</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">all 0.15s ease</span>;\n}\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn:hover</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">background</span>: <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">var</span>(<span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">--btn-hover-bg</span>);\n}\n\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn-secondary</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">--btn-bg</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#f0f1f4</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">--btn-color</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#121726</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">--btn-hover-bg</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#e2e5eb</span>;\n}\n\n<span style=\"color:#c792ea\">.btn-ghost</span> {\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">--btn-bg</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">transparent</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">--btn-color</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#3b82f6</span>;\n  <span style=\"color:#82aaff\">--btn-hover-bg</span>: <span style=\"color:#f78c6c\">#f0f1f4</span>;\n}",
      "codeFilename": "button.css",
      "preview": "<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"padding:5px 10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;border-radius:6px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;\">SM</span><span style=\"padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border-radius:8px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;\">MD</span><span style=\"padding:10px 22px;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;border-radius:10px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;\">LG</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border-radius:8px;background:#3b82f6;color:#fff;\">Primary</span><span style=\"padding:8px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border-radius:8px;background:#f0f1f4;color:#121726;\">Secondary</span><span style=\"padding:7px 15px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:#3b82f6;border:1px solid #e2e5eb;\">Ghost</span></div></div><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5a6375;margin-top:8px;\">Token-powered variant system</p>"
    }
  ]
}